# Async and cancellation

Methods that return `Task` or `Task<T>` are `async` and `await`. Do not return the Task un-awaited.

Pass `CancellationToken` from `ServerCallContext` or GraphQL into MediatR, EF, and gRPC clients.

```csharp
public override async Task<CreatePageResponse> CreatePage(
    CreatePageRequest request,
    ServerCallContext context) =>
    await mediator.Send(new CreatePageCommand(request), context.CancellationToken);

await context.SaveChangesAsync(cancellationToken);
```
